  "query_preview": "..\n(Friday through Monday)\nIssued at 134 AM CDT Tue Jul 21 2026\n\nA weak shortwave will round the northern portion of the upper ridge \non Friday, helping send a front into the area. Models are still not \nin great agreement on precipitation chances with the front, but at \nleast isolated showers and storms appear probable for at least \nportions of the area Friday afternoon and evening. Upper ridging \nwill then strengthen further over the region this weekend into early \nnext week, bringing a return of areawide triple digit heat and\nlowering precipitation chances to near zero through the remainder\nof the long term period. \n\nWare",
